sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Trader
    participant CD as CyberDeltaEngine
    participant ML as ML Module
    participant FRS as Funding Rate Strategy
    participant BP as Backpack API (CEX)
    participant HL as Hyperliquid API (DEX)
    participant PX as Paradex API (DEX)
    participant RM as Risk Management

    Note over CD,RM: Initialization Phase
    User->>CD: Initialize trading bot (Funding Rate Strategy)
    CD->>FRS: Initialize funding rate parameters
    CD->>ML: Load & activate ML models (E[FR], σ_mkt, C_target)
    ML->>ML: Retrain models daily (LSTM + XGBoost ensemble)
    ML-->>RM: Predict σ_mkt_t = f(Price_t, Vol_t, Sentiment_t)
    RM->>RM: Set VaR_t = α * σ_mkt_t * PV_t, CVaR_t = β * σ_mkt_t
    Note right of RM: Example: σ_mkt_t = 0.05, PV_t = $1M, VaR_t = $50k
    ML-->>RM: Validate predictions (MAE < 0.01 threshold)

    Note over CD,PX: Data Collection & Validation Phase
    loop Every 5 seconds
        par Fetch Data
            CD->>BP: Fetch prices, rates, depth, sentiment (Twitter API)
            BP-->>CD: Backpack Data
            CD->>HL: Fetch prices, rates, depth, sentiment
            HL-->>CD: Hyperliquid Data
            CD->>PX: Fetch prices, rates, depth, sentiment
            PX-->>CD: Paradex Data
        end
        CD->>ML: Autoencoder anomaly detection (Error_t > Threshold)
        ML-->>CD: Cleaned data (impute P_t = Transformer(P_{t-1}))
        ML-->>CD: Quality score Q_t = 1 - (Anomaly_t + Missing_t)
        CD->>CD: Cross-check: |P_BP - P_HL| < 0.03 * σ_spread
    end

    Note over CD,RM: Analysis Phase
    CD->>FRS: Process validated data
    FRS->>ML: Predict E[FR_t] = μ_FR + ε_t (LSTM-XGBoost)
    ML-->>FRS: E[FR_t], σ_B,t = NN(Price_t, Depth_t), conf = 0.95
    FRS->>FRS: π^X_t = E[FR_t] - C^X_t (non-linear cost model)
    FRS->>FRS: π^{AB}_t = E[FR^A_t - FR^B_t] - C^{AB}_t
    FRS->>ML: Dynamic K-means clustering (update centroids live)
    ML-->>FRS: Clustered signals (e.g., High π, Low σ group)
    FRS-->>CD: Enhanced signals
    CD->>RM: Optimize w_t = (π_t / σ_t^2) * α_t
    RM->>ML: Predict Σ_t via GNN (Graph Neural Network)
    ML-->>RM: Σ_t (e.g., corr(BP, HL) = 0.8)
    RM->>RM: Check √w_t^T Σ_t w_t < MaxRisk_t
    RM-->>CD: w_t (e.g., w_BP = 0.4, w_HL = 0.6)

    Note over CD,RM: Collateral Check / Rebalancing Phase
    RM->>ML: Predict C_target_t = E[C_needed_t] + 1.5 * σ_C_t
    ML-->>RM: C_target^BP = $400k, C_target^HL = $500k
    RM->>BP: Fetch C_current^BP
    BP-->>RM: C_current^BP = $350k
    RM->>HL: Fetch C_current^HL
    HL-->>RM: C_current^HL = $520k
    RM->>PX: Fetch C_current^PX
    PX-->>RM: C_current^PX = $200k
    alt |C_current - C_target| > Buffer
        RM->>ML: Predict TC_t = MLP(Fee_t, Gas_t), L_t = RNN(Congestion_t)
        ML-->>RM: TC_t = $10, L_t = 5min, Path = BP → HL
        RM->>RM: Add buffer: C_buffer = 0.1 * σ_C_t
        par Transfer
            RM->>BP: Withdraw $50k (USDC)
            RM->>HL: Deposit $50k (on-chain)
        end
        BP-->>RM: Status: confirmed
    end

    Note over CD,User: Decision & Execution Phase
    CD->>ML: Predict P(VolSpike_t) = HMM(Price_t, σ_t)
    ML-->>CD: P(VolSpike_t) = 0.8 (delay if > RL_Threshold_t)
    CD->>ML: Optimize timing: Action_t = RL(Q_t(Execute, Wait))
    ML-->>CD: Action_t = Execute
    CD->>ML: Predict Slippage_t = SVR(Depth_t, Volume_t)
    ML-->>CD: Slippage_t = 0.002
    alt Single-Exchange
        CD->>HL: Execute Long Perp + Hedge (Slippage_t adjusted)
    else Cross-Exchange
        CD->>BP: Short Perp (Leg 1)
        CD->>HL: Long Perp (Leg 2, FOK)
    end
    CD->>RM: Update positions & risk

    Note over CD,User: Monitoring & Adaptation Phase
    loop Every funding period
        par Collect Funding
            CD->>BP: Fetch funding data
            BP-->>CD: Funding_t^BP
            CD->>HL: Fetch funding data
            HL-->>CD: Funding_t^HL
            CD->>PX: Fetch funding data
            PX-->>CD: Funding_t^PX
        end
        CD->>ML: Analyze PnL_t, Yield_t = Funding_t / Capital_t
        ML->>ML: Detect drift: |Sharpe_t - Sharpe_{t-1}| > 0.5
        ML-->>CD: Metrics + Drift Alert
    end
    loop Real-Time Adaptation
        CD->>ML: RL Update: α_t = α_{t-1} + η * ∇Q_t(PnL_t - λ * σ_P_t)
        ML-->>FRS: Optimized α_t (e.g., 0.4)
        FRS->>RM: Adjust w_t = (π_t / σ_t^2) * α_t
        ML->>ML: Stress test with GANs (Synthetic_t)
    end
    CD->>User: Dashboard: PnL_t = $5k, Yield_t = 0.01, VaR_t = $10k